      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ZENVO YOYO (2) showed little early speed at her last couple, the latest finishing fourth (44.92) in a Grade 5/6 at Angle Park. Can make amends. SECRETS WE KEEP (6) boasts a strong record this journey with four wins and four minors from 12 tries. Was out of placings last time (43.94) at Angle Park in a Special conditions race, finishing seventh and beaten 15 lengths. Can feature with the right run. URANA SPACE (1) turned in a fair 4th placed finish last time at this track over 530m (30.13). Returns to a course where she has performed well. Goes well out of this box with a win and two minor placings. Shapes as one to consider. ZIPPING MOWGLI (4) is a last-start placegetter who is in the mix again.",
